  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7180902",
      "subQuestName": "Look for poetic inspiration at the south wharf",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090201": {
            "id": "718090201",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "All is well, all is well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090202"
            ]
          },
          "718090202": {
            "id": "718090202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090203"
            ]
          },
          "718090203": {
            "id": "718090203",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "Oh, it's you, Traveler. So, there was a big incident in the city earlier, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090204"
            ]
          },
          "718090204": {
            "id": "718090204",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "Well, it's well that nothing untoward happened afterward... And more importantly, it's well that all the food stalls in the city are still open.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090205"
            ]
          },
          "718090205": {
            "id": "718090205",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "I mean, what would become of all those delicacies I enjoyed otherwise...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090206"
            ]
          },
          "718090206": {
            "id": "718090206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ah, so it's about eating, then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090207"
            ]
          },
          "718090207": {
            "id": "718090207",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "Hey, don't you look down on it. The quickest way to know if a place is good or not is to see how its cuisine tastes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090208"
            ]
          },
          "718090208": {
            "id": "718090208",
            "speakerId": 2060,
            "speakerName": "Hao",
            "text": "Ah, just talking about this is making me hungry again. Maybe I should go get a little something..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7180903",
      "subQuestName": "Look for poetic inspiration at Bubu Pharmacy",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090301": {
            "id": "718090301",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "The more I hear of this opera, the less I understand it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090302"
            ]
          },
          "718090302": {
            "id": "718090302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is something wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090303"
            ]
          },
          "718090303": {
            "id": "718090303",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "Why, hello there, Traveler. Well, here's the problem: Heyu Tea House has released a few new operas lately.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090304"
            ]
          },
          "718090304": {
            "id": "718090304",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "But they're— Well, they're most lively, that's for sure. But I do not quite comprehend them, or how the young people seem to enjoy it so very much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090305"
            ]
          },
          "718090305": {
            "id": "718090305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And how do you feel about that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090306"
            ]
          },
          "718090306": {
            "id": "718090306",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "That's a good question. Personally, I don't mind hearing some old classics. They're what I'm used to, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090307"
            ]
          },
          "718090307": {
            "id": "718090307",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "But at the same time, Liyue Harbor is undergoing so many changes. A few new operas seem to fit the reigning mood just fine, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090308"
            ]
          },
          "718090308": {
            "id": "718090308",
            "speakerId": 2011,
            "speakerName": "Fan Er'ye",
            "text": "*sigh* Still, these changes feel all too swift. The old operas haven't played in a while. I wonder what Rex Lapis would— No, let us not speak of that..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7180904",
      "subQuestName": "Look for poetic inspiration near Yujing Terrace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090401": {
            "id": "718090401",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "What have you learned, my liege?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090402"
            ]
          },
          "718090402": {
            "id": "718090402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A fair bit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090403"
            ]
          },
          "718090403": {
            "id": "718090403",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Oh, verily? Please, do share.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090404"
            ]
          },
          "718090404": {
            "id": "718090404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There are lots of dogs by the south wharf.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090405"
            ]
          },
          "718090405": {
            "id": "718090405",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Oh, good, good. Most lively indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090406"
            ]
          },
          "718090406": {
            "id": "718090406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Bubu Pharmacy hosts many finches nearby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090407"
            ]
          },
          "718090407": {
            "id": "718090407",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Finches, yes... A sign of peaceful times. Lovely poetic imagery.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090408"
            ]
          },
          "718090408": {
            "id": "718090408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Some only care for eating...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090409"
            ]
          },
          "718090409": {
            "id": "718090409",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Haha, there is nothing wrong with that. Eating is one of the prime needs and joys of life — especially in a city such as Liyue Harbor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090410"
            ]
          },
          "718090410": {
            "id": "718090410",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Yes, this too is quite fascinating. I will record this. It may yet be of use.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090411"
            ]
          },
          "718090411": {
            "id": "718090411",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Some feel that things are changing too quickly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090412"
            ]
          },
          "718090412": {
            "id": "718090412",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Hmm, that too is as we should expect. To some, Liyue must almost seem to be shedding its skin with every passing day. Even I find it hard to keep up or accept every single shift...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090413"
            ]
          },
          "718090413": {
            "id": "718090413",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "But this is a matter most broad — I fear that a single poem may not capture it adequately. Still, I shall write it down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090414"
            ]
          },
          "718090414": {
            "id": "718090414",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "That should do for now. I see that I chose wisely in seeking your aid, my liege.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090415"
            ]
          },
          "718090415": {
            "id": "718090415",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I believe that this will add at least a few new entries to my next anthology.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090416"
            ]
          },
          "718090416": {
            "id": "718090416",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Ah, yes, apart from some material goods, I have also prepared a little gift for you. Please take it as thanks for your succour.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090417"
            ]
          },
          "718090417": {
            "id": "718090417",
            "speakerId": 2205,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Once my new anthology is published, you may exchange this signature for a free copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
